WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
It's the greatest con job ever perpetrated on the world,

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.000
in my opinion.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.320
Climate change, no matter what happens,

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.280
you're involved in that.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.920
No more global warming, no more global cooling.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.480
All of these predictions made by the United Nations

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.400
and many others, often for bad reasons, were wrong.

